al/tya34K7D4jtDrVbvExyvTx97Aen.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After an earthquake destroys their underwater station, six researchers must navigate two miles along the dangerous, unknown depths of the ocean floor to make it to safety in a race against time.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":726139,\"title\":\"Project Silence\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lZT5Cq4wkz7IeJEnz94U94xuEWD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cIBp7rip1kZLSD7BQrEE4UXs6aq.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Due to sudden deteriorating weather conditions, visibility on the Airport Bridge is severely impaired, leaving people stranded and at risk of the bridge collapsing due to a series of chain collisions and explosions. Amidst the chaos, the canine subjects \\\"Echo\\\" from the military experiment \\\"Project Silence,\\\" who were being transported in secret, break free, and all human survivors become targets of relentless attacks.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Action\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10304,\"title\":\"Starship Troopers 2: Hero of the Federation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9iqrqOjLaFcGNnSQlJxYLfgrhqn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/VFQsmdsqyKWdMi2Pb77cAD4akk.jpg\",\"rating\":4.4,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of troopers take refuge in an abandoned outpost after fighting alien bugs, failing to realize that more danger lays in wait.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Horror\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1205229,\"title\":\"Night of the Zoopocalypse\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nCejOVZcOxKS27nnbh28NKXOdXF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h2SEtzuABKmcZAnKBJ1za3kETTY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A wolf and mountain lion team up when a meteor unleashes a virus turning zoo animals into zombies. They join forces with other survivors to rescue the zoo and stop the deranged mutant leader from spreading the virus.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":36243,\"title\":\"Godzilla, Mothra and King Ghidorah: Giant Monsters All-Out Attack\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d3lMCQJfjCBlGFy5sWpsEaBnEPl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/flIztIygNv3r3wgJCDyxfnvH70K.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Godzilla has become a distant memory for Japan when the destruction of a US submarine raises alarms for Admiral Tachibana. His estranged daughter Yuri investigates the legend of the guardian monsters, who must rise to protect Japan against the vengeful spirits within Godzilla that seek to destroy both the nation and its people for the suffering they inflicted in the Pacific conflict.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1450,\"title\":\"Blood: The Last Vampire\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uzuYpbdFkNYqnBdOvhWqZxhHa5C.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ryBUkjVLKjSJOTgBfxHrdu7rxG0.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On the surface, Saya is a stunning 16-year-old, but that youthful exterior hides the tormented soul of a 400-year-old \\\"halfling\\\". Born to a human father and a vampire mother, she has for centuries been a loner obsessed with using her samurai skills to rid the world of vampires, all the while knowing that she herself can survive only on blood like those she hunts.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":627661,\"title\":\"Cranston Academy: Monster Zone\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fIhtLxiBhGHiSXSVJ1FzUrAuKCo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lvNQKZUsw7pg79CROCFlIk8PT67.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An intelligent 15-year-old high school student is unexpectedly transferred to a boarding school where he opens a portal of monsters from another dimension.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16774,\"title\":\"Hellboy Animated: Sword of Storms\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vUCrcikFCDsvA6IiS59kdfQkseU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d8VGgwr2WApwFewrL5yZQgo78E0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A folklore professor becomes unwittingly possessed by the ancient Japanese demons of Thunder and Lightning. But when The Bureau of Paranormal Research & Defense dispatches a team of agents to investigate, a cursed samurai sword sends Hellboy to a supernatural dimension of ghosts, monsters, and feudal mayhem. Now while pyrokinetic Liz Sherman and fishboy Abe Sapien battle one very pissed-off dragon, a lost and cranky Hellboy must find his way home.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16266,\"title\":\"2012 Doomsday\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rNHdpeyBUki4n5tzEdEri5elJBq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Z5OHKXF0j06Wtm1dLSz7orY7jT.jpg\",\"rating\":3.2,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On December 21, 2012 four strangers on a journey of faith are drawn to an ancient temple in the heart of Mexico. For the Mayans it is the last recorded day. For NASA scientists it is a cataclysmic polar shift. For the rest of us, it is Doomsday.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1061474,\"title\":\"Superman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ombsmhYUqR4qqOLOxAyr5V8hbyv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eGX66zonvc4bXg3rM08RUxdYSDx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Superman, a journalist in Metropolis, embarks on a journey to reconcile his Kryptonian heritage with his hum